From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:53:23 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 68/68] MIPS: configs: ad5x: Enable the watchdog

The watchdog driver restarts the board; without it reboot hangs.
---
 arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig b/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig
index ae26804b2..76d85fcb7 100644
--- a/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/configs/ad5x_defconfig
@@ -48,6 +48,8 @@ CONFIG_SERIAL_OF_PLATFORM=y
 CONFIG_I2C_JZ4780=y
 CONFIG_GPIO_SYSFS=y
 # CONFIG_HWMON is not set
+CONFIG_WATCHDOG=y
+CONFIG_JZ4740_WDT=y
 CONFIG_REGULATOR=y
 CONFIG_REGULATOR_FIXED_VOLTAGE=y
 CONFIG_DRM=y
-- 
2.43.0

